        "html": "<div class=\"imtblocks\">\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">kaatYi</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">thus, like this</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">kata</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">like, as, as if, seem</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">tiriiku</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">wheat</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">pothe-n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">rot, decay-mediopass.</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ussi</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">why, because</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ekwe</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">not, no</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">pusse=k</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">resurrect, revive=he/she/it</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ekwe</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">not, no</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ya</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">and, also, too</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">icco-mpi-hne</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">come out-make, cause, let-passive</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">Tarah-tak</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">sky, heaven-at, in, to, on</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">kaatYi</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">thus, like this</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ya</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">and, also, too</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">nossow</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">breath, spirit, life</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">pothe-n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">rot, decay-mediopass.</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ekeT-sum</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">sins, badness, evil-with, by means of</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ussi</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">why, because</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ekwe</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">not, no</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">hapre-pu</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">shake off-to oneself</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">neppe</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">this</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">uti</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">more, would rather</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ekwe</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">not, no</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">hitwi-hne</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">clean, erase, correct-passive</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">uti</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">more, would rather</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ekwe</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">not, no</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ya</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">and, also, too</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">icco-mpi-hne</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">come out-make, cause, let-passive</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">Samalpu-s-tak-tum</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">confess-nominalizer-at, in, to, on-from</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n",
