        "trs": "Thus, just like wheat rots because it does not revive, and also it is not brought to heaven (is not brough into the open air?), also thus the soul rots from sin, because this does not shake itself off (of sin), more, this (the soul) is not cleansed, rather also it is not brought out from the confession.",
